&temp:          +borrow use 6 ~borrow
tuple:          +tup0 +tup1 ~tup1 use 4 4 ~tup0
array:          +arr0 +arr1 use 2 ~arr1 ~arr0
struct lit:     +field +plain ~plain use 5 5 ~field
block tail:     in block +blocktail use 9 ~blocktail
&temp.field:    +proj use 4 ~proj
method recv:    +method ~method use 6
fn arg:         +fnarg ~fnarg use 5
field of temp:  +byval ~byval use 5
paren/cast:     +paren +cast use 5 true ~cast ~paren
&*Box::new:     +deref use 5 ~deref
if arms:        +if-arm use 6 ~if-arm
vec owned:      +v0 +v1 use 2 ~v0 ~v1
match value:    +scrut ~scrut use 0
Some(&temp):    +some-arg use Some(8) ~some-arg
